# Exact-output snapshot of every registered indicator — see musescript/tools/IndicatorGolden.hx.
# Used to prove the Array.shift() -> RingBuffer migration (ALGORITHM_AUDIT.md §2) is
# numerically neutral: snapshot before, migrate, snapshot after, diff must be empty.
extraParams.hxml
-main musescript.tools.IndicatorGolden
-lib hxnodejs
-D node
-D js_es=6
-js build/js/indicator-golden.js
